rding B9 is strategically superior because it leaves me waiting for W3 to complete my hand, which has 2 copies remaining unshown versus only 1 copy of B9. This doubles my chances of winning. With 4 exposed melds already, I'm in a strong position to win quickly if W3 appears.\n\nAnswer: \nPlay B9"}
